		{"id":"n0017","type":"text","text":"> [!economy] [[Sustaining Discipline]] *(Level 8)*\n> **Prereq:** PRE 3 · Aethermancy (Skilled)\n> \n> *You can keep effects running with less constant strain.*","x":40,"y":-1432,"width":425,"height":200},
