		{"id":"n0087","type":"text","text":"> [!economy] [[Economy Specialist]] *(Level 4)*\n> **Prereq:** WIT 2 · Aethermancy (Skilled)\n> \n> *You learn to make smaller, cleaner evocations for the same result.*","x":-583,"y":-1332,"width":425,"height":200},
		{"id":"n0025","type":"text","text":"> [!counter] [[Residue Analyst]] *(Level 2)*\n> **Prereq:** WIT 1 · Aetherology (Skilled)\n> \n> *You can read residue as evidence: intent, direction, and technique.*","x":-1011,"y":-2040,"width":425,"height":200},
		{"id":"n0096","type":"text","text":"> [!weave] [[Weave Adept II]] *(Level 6)*\n> **Prereq:** WIT 2 · Aetherics (Skilled)\n> \n> *You internalize the common scaffolding that most weaves share.*","x":-385,"y":-2440,"width":425,"height":200},
		{"id":"n0065","type":"text","text":"> [!life] [[Life - Guiding Pulse]] *(Level 8)*\n> **Prereq:** CON 3 · Aethermancy (Mastered)\n> \n> *Your healing is also direction and coordination.*","x":14,"y":1980,"width":425,"height":200},
		{"id":"n0066","type":"text","text":"> [!life] [[Life - Micro-Agency]] *(Level 10)*\n> **Prereq:** CON 3,INT 1 · Aethermancy (Mastered)\n> \n> *You can give small things a will of their own.*","x":943,"y":1920,"width":425,"height":200},
		{"id":"n0067","type":"text","text":"> [!life] [[Life Technique - Dominance]] *(Level 10)*\n> **Prereq:** CON 3 · Aethermancy (Mastered)\n> \n> *You can impose life terms on the battlefield.*","x":518,"y":2180,"width":425,"height":200}
	],
